# Simulation save states -- NEVER commit these.
# They are machine-local derived artifacts (a single earth.pkl is ~100 MB and
# grows as PlanetState gains fields), and every commit that touches one adds
# another ~100 MB to repo history permanently. saves/earth.pkl was force-added
# past these rules once before and reached 102 MiB, which exceeds GitHub's hard
# 100 MiB per-file limit and made the repo unpushable (2026-07-25).
# If you need to share a save, put it somewhere other than git.
# Do NOT `git add -f` anything under saves/.
/saves/
/saves/**
*.pkl

*.pyc
/overnight/
/_planetsim_wt_blend/
